<title>USA: Ha-Lo Industries Inc Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>Ha-Lo Industries Inc Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>NILES, Ill. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.27		    $0.11</p>
<p> Net			  4,722		    1,721</p>
<p> Revs			79,019		   69,208</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  17,720		   15,171</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.53		    $0.33</p>
<p> Net			  9,371		    4,673</p>
<p> Revs		     254,888		  211,266</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  17,581		   14,091</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 Q4 and 12-mos net includes after tax non-recurring charge of $1 million, or $0.08/shr, related to the acquisition of Fletcher-Barnhardt &amp; White in December 1995. 1996 12-mos net includes after tax non-recurring charge of $1 million, or $0.06/shr, related to acquisition of Market USA in September 1996. All periods include results of Fletcher-Barnhardt &amp; White and Market USA, which were accounted for as pooling-of-interests. Shr figures reflect 3-for-2 stock split in June 1996 and 25-pct stock dividend in December 1996.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
